---
import Page from '../components/Page.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';
---
<Page title="Privacy" description="What personal data Orkhon Atlas collects, and what it does not." path="/privacy/">
  <p>This policy explains what happens to personal data when you use orkhonatlas.tourground.com. The data controller is Tourground. Contact: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>
  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>No accounts, no analytics, no advertising trackers.</strong> The site does not run analytics scripts, advertising tags or social media embeds.</li>
    <li><strong>Server logs.</strong> The site is hosted on Vercel. Like any web host, Vercel processes technical data such as your IP address, browser type and the pages requested, to deliver the site and keep it secure. See <a href="https://vercel.com/legal/privacy-policy">Vercel's privacy policy</a>.</li>
    <li><strong>Newsletter and email.</strong> If you sign up for the newsletter or email us, your email client sends us a message containing your email address. We use it only to send you new stories or to reply, and we delete it when you unsubscribe or ask us to.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Links to other sites</h2>
  <p>Posts link to official sources and to operators' websites, including sites on Tourground. Those sites have their own privacy policies.</p>
  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>You can ask to see, correct or delete personal data we hold about you by emailing <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>. If you are in the UK or EU you can also complain to your data protection authority.</p>
  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>If this policy changes, we update the date at the top of this page.</p>
</Page>
